  "spans": {
    "s0": {
      "kind": "given",
      "parent": null,
      "text": "The lighthouse keeper wrote in his log:",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.35"
    },
    "s1": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s0", 39],
      "text": " “At 5:00 a.m. I turned on the light. At 7:00 p.m. I turned it off.” How many",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.35",
      "params": "p0",
      "seed": 31415,
      "batch": "b0",
      "index": 0,
      "slice_start": ["s0", 0]
    },
    "s2": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s0", 39],
      "text": " \"At 6:00 am, we saw the light of the lighthouse of island A for the first time; at 8:40 am",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.35",
      "params": "p0",
      "seed": 31416,
      "batch": "b0",
      "index": 1,
      "slice_start": ["s0", 0]
    },
    "s3": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s0", 39],
      "text": " \"At 4:45, the first ship left the port, and every 60 minutes another ship leaves. At 16:45",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.35",
      "params": "p0",
      "seed": 31417,
      "batch": "b0",
      "index": 2,
      "slice_start": ["s0", 0]
    },
    "s4": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s0", 39],
      "text": " \"At 6 am, I lit the lamp. At 11 am, I extinguished it. At 6 pm, I relit it.\"",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.35",
      "params": "p0",
      "seed": 31418,
      "batch": "b0",
      "index": 3,
      "slice_start": ["s0", 0]
    },
    "s5": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s0", 39],
      "text": " \"At 6:00 AM, I observed a ship and a buoy 50 kilometers away from the lighthouse at the same time. At ",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.35",
      "params": "p0",
      "seed": 31419,
      "batch": "b0",
      "index": 4,
      "slice_start": ["s0", 0]
    },
    "s6": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s0", 39],
      "text": " \"At 6:00 PM, I noticed that the angle between the hour and minute hands was the same as the angle at 4:00",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.35",
      "params": "p0",
      "seed": 31420,
      "batch": "b0",
      "index": 5,
      "slice_start": ["s0", 0]
    },
    "s7": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s0", 39],
      "text": " \"At 6:00 am, we saw the lighthouse of island A for the first time; at 12:00 noon, we",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.35",
      "params": "p0",
      "seed": 31421,
      "batch": "b0",
      "index": 6,
      "slice_start": ["s0", 0]
    },
    "s8": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s0", 39],
      "text": " \"On May 1st at 3:30 AM, the light went out, I quickly replaced the fuse, and the light returned to normal.\"",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.35",
      "params": "p0",
      "seed": 31422,
      "batch": "b0",
      "index": 7,
      "slice_start": ["s0", 0]
    },
    "s9": {
      "kind": "given",
      "parent": null,
      "text": "There are three kinds of silence. The first is",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.43"
    },
    "s10": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s9", 46],
      "text": " the silence of the grave. The second is the silence of the heart. The third is the silence of the mind.\nThe silence of the",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.43",
      "params": "p1",
      "seed": 31423,
      "batch": "b1",
      "index": 0,
      "slice_start": ["s9", 0]
    },
    "s11": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s9", 46],
      "text": " the silence of the one who has nothing to say. The second is the silence of the one who is too weak to say it. The",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.43",
      "params": "p1",
      "seed": 31424,
      "batch": "b1",
      "index": 1,
      "slice_start": ["s9", 0]
    },
    "s12": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s9", 46],
      "text": " the silence of the fool. He is afraid to speak, and so he keeps silent. The second is the silence of the wise man.",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.43",
      "params": "p1",
      "seed": 31425,
      "batch": "b1",
      "index": 2,
      "slice_start": ["s9", 0]
    },
    "s13": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s9", 46],
      "text": " when you are alone. You are there with yourself. And there is nothing to say. The second is when you are with someone who is",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.46",
      "params": "p2",
      "seed": 31426,
      "batch": "b2",
      "index": 0,
      "slice_start": ["s9", 0]
    },
    "s14": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s9", 46],
      "text": " when you have nothing to say. This silence is comfortable and good. The second is when you have something important to say, but you are",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.46",
      "params": "p2",
      "seed": 31427,
      "batch": "b2",
      "index": 1,
      "slice_start": ["s9", 0]
    },
    "s15": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s9", 46],
      "text": " the silence of the person who has nothing to say. It is generally a temporary condition. The second is the silence of the person who has",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.46",
      "params": "p2",
      "seed": 31428,
      "batch": "b2",
      "index": 2,
      "slice_start": ["s9", 0]
    },
    "s16": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s9", 46],
      "text": " the silence of a person who is listening. His mouth is close, but his mind is far. He hears and understands, he remembers and",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.49",
      "params": "p3",
      "seed": 31429,
      "batch": "b3",
      "index": 0,
      "slice_start": ["s9", 0]
    },
    "s17": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s9", 46],
      "text": " the silence of a man who is in possession of all the truth and who knows that to give more than he gives would be to give falsehood",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.49",
      "params": "p3",
      "seed": 31430,
      "batch": "b3",
      "index": 1,
      "slice_start": ["s9", 0]
    },
    "s18": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s9", 46],
      "text": " the silence of the dead. It is a heavy and oppressive silence. It is a silence which can never be broken. It is the silence",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.49",
      "params": "p3",
      "seed": 31431,
      "batch": "b3",
      "index": 2,
      "slice_start": ["s9", 0]
    },
    "s19": {
      "kind": "given",
      "parent": null,
      "text": "A note on method. The instrument records what a model does when it is iterated against itself: which continuations recur, how much of the prior has to be visible before they do, and whether anything survives being passed forward repeatedly. Nothing here is a claim about meaning. It is a record of what came back, under conditions written down beside it. The first thing worth saying about the results is",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.51"
    },
    "s20": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s19", 404],
      "text": " that they are all statistically significant. The result for the test of the whole model is not, but that is the case in many applications where",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.51",
      "params": "p4",
      "seed": 31432,
      "batch": "b4",
      "index": 0,
      "slice_start": ["s19", 364]
    },
    "s21": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s19", 404],
      "text": " that they do not contradict the notion that the universe is isotropic and homogeneous in large scales. But it also means that the matter distribution in",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.51",
      "params": "p4",
      "seed": 31433,
      "batch": "b4",
      "index": 1,
      "slice_start": ["s19", 364]
    },
    "s22": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s19", 404],
      "text": " that they are all of them true. The second thing worth saying is that they all come back to the same thing. The third thing worth",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.53",
      "params": "p5",
      "seed": 31434,
      "batch": "b5",
      "index": 0,
      "slice_start": ["s19", 0]
    },
    "s23": {
      "kind": "sampled",
      "parent": ["s19", 404],
      "text": " how stable the results are. For all the models, and all the variations of each, the first thing to say is that it is almost",
      "created": "2026-08-15-18.54.53",
      "params": "p5",
      "seed": 31435,
      "batch": "b5",
      "index": 1,
      "slice_start": ["s19", 0]
    },
